        "answer": {
          "short": "$3\\sqrt7$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}XC^2&=BC^2-BX^2\\\\XC^2&=(2\\sqrt{17})^2-(\\sqrt5)^2\\\\XC^2&=68-5\\\\XC&=\\sqrt{63}\\\\XC&=3\\sqrt7\\end{align*}$$",
